96
00:17:12,159 --> 00:17:21,739
戻れない場所と知りながら 散り行く花びら 手のひらにのせて
Knowing it's a place we cannot return to, I place falling petals upon my palm...

97
00:17:29,739 --> 00:17:37,519
花明かりに誘われて 胸の中に降り積もる
Lured by the cherry blossom lamplight, it piles up within my chest...

98
00:17:38,399 --> 00:17:49,719
光と影 舞い散る吹雪の 思い出だけ 白く染めてく...
Light and shadow, a blizzard of dancing snowflakes—only memories dye everything in white...

99
00:17:54,859 --> 00:18:03,359
ひらひら ひらら きらきら きらら 瞼の裏暗闇に浮かぶ桜
Fluttering, glittering, cherry blossoms float in the dark behind my eyelids...

100
00:18:04,059 --> 00:18:11,159
水面に落ちたら 君は もう一度咲くのかな
If they fall onto the water's surface, will you bloom once more?

101
00:18:11,939 --> 00:18:20,379
サヨナラしたら 会えないのでしょうか 言えないままの気持ちだけが
If we say goodbye, will we never meet again? Only feelings left unsaid...

102
00:18:21,119 --> 00:18:27,539
花びらに変わっても... 君と出会った 去年の春と
Even if they turn into petals, meeting you last spring...

103
00:18:28,219 --> 00:18:37,939
同じ場所で同じ景色見つめてた 咲き誇るほどに痛む 君がいない桜
In the same place, I gazed at the same scenery. Blooming so proudly it hurts, cherry blossoms without you...

104
00:18:42,059 --> 00:18:50,419
夢の中でも 羽が散ってゆく 暗闇に浮かんだ桜が
Feathers scatter even in dreams, cherry blossoms floating in the dark...

105
00:18:51,239 --> 00:18:57,259
水面に落ちたら また会えるのかな
If they fall onto the water's surface, will we meet again?

106
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:40,020
[Title: 極楽浄土]
[Title: Gokuraku Jōdo]

107
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:47,520
今宵も月が誘うお方に 魅せられて私は
Tonight, too, the moon invites us, enchanted, I am...

108
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:59,020
爛々と咲き誇る エデンの東
Blooming brilliantly, east of Eden...

109
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:13,360
月明り昇る刻 灯る赤提灯
When the moonlight rises, red lanterns glow.

110
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:20,360
祭囃子の合図 ふわり 蝶が誘い出す
The signal of festival music, gently enticing butterflies to flutter out.

111
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:24,460
ちょいと覗いて見てごらん
Take a little peek and see...

112
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:27,860
迷い込めば 抜け出せない
If you wander in, you can't escape.

113
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:31,360
楽しいことがしたいなら
If you want to have fun,

114
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:35,060
おいでませ 極楽浄土
Welcome to the Pure Land of Utmost Bliss.

115
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:42,360
歌えや歌え心のままに アナタの声をさぁ聞かせて
Sing, oh sing, straight from the heart, come on, let me hear your voice!

116
00:20:43,060 --> 00:20:49,560
踊れや踊れ時を忘れ 今宵共にあゝ狂い咲き
Dance, oh dance, forgetting the time, blooming madly together tonight!

117
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:12,160
美しく咲く花も いつか散りゆくもの
Even flowers that bloom so beautifully will eventually scatter away.

118
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:18,560
それならこの一夜を もっと 熱く 愛したい
If so, I want to love this single night even more passionately.

119
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:23,060
ちょいといいこといたしましょう
Let's do something a little nice...

120
00:21:23,860 --> 00:21:29,860
これは夢か幻か 嘘も真も無い世界
Is this a dream or an illusion? A world where neither lies nor truths exist.

121
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:34,260
ゆきましょう 極楽浄土
Let's go to the Pure Land of Utmost Bliss.

122
00:21:35,060 --> 00:21:41,560
歌えや歌え 心のままに 乱れる髪も気にせず
Sing, oh sing, straight from the heart, without minding your disheveled hair!

123
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:49,060
踊れや踊れ 時を忘れ 今宵共にあゝ狂い咲き
Dance, oh dance, forgetting the time, blooming madly together tonight!

124
