00:22:30,860 --> 00:22:34,260
ゆきましょう 極楽浄土
Let's go to the Pure Land of Utmost Bliss.

127
00:22:35,060 --> 00:22:41,560
歌えや歌え心のままに アナタの声をさぁ聞かせて
Sing, oh sing, straight from the heart, come on, let me hear your voice!

128
00:22:42,060 --> 00:22:49,360
踊れや踊れ時を忘れ 今宵共にあゝ狂い咲き
Dance, oh dance, forgetting the time, blooming madly together tonight!

129
00:22:50,060 --> 00:22:53,560
今宵アナタと狂い咲き
Blooming madly with you tonight!

130
00:23:49,056 --> 00:23:53,056
[Title: 許婚っきゅん]
[Title: Iinazuke Kyun]

131
00:24:01,060 --> 00:24:06,560
どいつもこいつも なんだかやっぱノーテンキ
Everyone is always alway so carefree.

132
00:24:07,060 --> 00:24:10,560
雑多でハンパな憂鬱どもは群れをなし
Messy, half-baked sorrows gather in flocks.

133
00:24:11,060 --> 00:24:13,560
アタマの中はぐちゃぐちゃさ
Inside your head, it's all a total mess!

134
00:24:21,060 --> 00:24:26,560
ドンマイ 弊害 意気地がないの方程式 イケナイイケナイ事柄なんてないから
Don't mind, setbacks, the equation of lacking courage—there's no such thing as a forbidden deed!

135
00:24:27,556 --> 00:24:32,556
イーアルサンスー じゃんけんポンで さあお逝き ウーリューチーパークーで天に召されてく
Yi, er, san, si, rock-paper-scissors, go on and pass away, summoned to the heavens!

136
00:24:33,560 --> 00:24:36,560
キミは もうハイスピードだな
You're already going at high speed!

137
00:24:37,060 --> 00:24:42,560
ありゃま こりゃま お待ちかね ハチャでメチャなドラマ
Oh my, well well, long-awaited, a chaotic drama!

138
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:46,560
派手にドラが乗るよ
The gong rings out flashily!

139
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:52,560
い・い・許婚っきゅん I love you なのだ 四六時中愛をちょうだい
I-I-Iinazuke Kyun, I love you, so give me love twenty-four seven!

140
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:59,560
い・い・一か八ッキュン I・哀・逢・愛 罠ろっきゅー 2分の1じゃものたんない
I-I-Ichikahachkyun, I-sorrow-meeting-love trap rock six, half is just not enough!

141
00:25:13,314 --> 00:25:19,004
それでも結局見えない アイツの胸の裡
Even so, I still can't see deep inside that person's heart...

142
00:25:19,554 --> 00:25:22,604
先輩 後輩 ヤンキー 雀鬼 カンケーない
Senpai, kouhai, yankee, mahjong master—none of that matters!

143
00:25:22,604 --> 00:25:25,304
いざ尋本当に勝負
Now, let's have a proper showdown!

144
00:25:32,904 --> 00:25:36,204
君がもしも その気なら
If you're feeling that way, then...

145
00:25:36,204 --> 00:25:41,104
Boy meets girl が始まりそうならさ
If a boy meets girl story is about to begin, then...

146
00:25:42,054 --> 00:25:44,904
まだ見ぬ技 繰り出す
Unleashing techniques yet unseen...

147
00:25:45,404 --> 00:25:49,104
僕らってば so sweet だな
Aren't we just so sweet, after all?

148
00:25:49,554 --> 00:25:52,304
アレなとこが同じだね
Those weird parts of ours are the same, huh?

149
00:25:52,854 --> 00:25:55,404
へちゃむくれな修羅場
A pathetic, messy battlefield scene...

150
00:25:55,804 --> 00:25:58,404
派手に銅鑼が鳴るよ
A gong rings out loudly!

151
00:25:59,154 --> 00:26:04,254
意味深な like you 曖昧な愛より直球
A meaningful "like you" is a straight pitch rather than vague love.

152
00:26:04,254 --> 00:26:07,554
しのごの言わず察してちょうだい
Stop making excuses and just figure it out!

153
00:26:07,554 --> 00:26:11,254
いちびるな天誅！鼻血ブーなのだ
Don't get cocky, divine punishment! It's enough to make your nose bleed!

154
00:26:11,254 --> 00:26:14,904
自分の意思はどんなもんじゃい
What is your own willpower anyway?

155
00:26:15,054 --> 00:26:18,054
い・い・許婚っきゅん I love you なのだ
G-G-Good fiancee-kyun, I love you, you know!

156
00:26:18,054 --> 00:26:21,254
四六時中愛をちょうだい
Give me love around the clock!

157
00:26:21,854 --> 00:26:25,154
2分の1じゃものたんない
Half isn't enough to satisfy!

158
00:26:25,154 --> 00:26:28,304
是なんて試練 靉靆かもしれん
Is this sort of trial perhaps hazy and vast...

159
00:26:28,554 --> 00:26:31,154
毎晩奇想聴牌 足りないや
Every night, bizarre imaginative tenpai, it's not enough!

160
00:26:31,254 --> 00:26:35,104
空前絶後 天真爛漫
Unprecedented and innocent...

161
00:26:35,154 --> 00:26:38,304
偏愛無常 免許皆伝
Biased love is impermanent, fully licensed!

162
00:27:15,404 --> 00:27:18,604
せーのっ いちにっさん、はいっ！ 回レ！雪月花
Ready, set—One, two, three, go! Spin around, Setsugetsuka!

163
00:27:21,604 --> 00:27:22,604
いよーっ ぽん!
Yo, pon!

164
00:27:28,954 --> 00:27:34,604
さぁさぁさぁ これよりご覧いただきますのは カブキ者たちの栄枯盛衰
Now, what you are about to witness is the rise and fall of kabuki performers...

165
00:27:35,104 --> 00:27:41,604
時代は常に日進月歩 聞いてってよ老若男女 一見は勧善懲悪 悪者どもを一刀両断
Times are always progressing step by step, listen up young and old! Seen at a glance it's good versus evil, cutting down villains in one swift stroke!

166
00:27:41,604 --> 00:27:44,304
「でもホントにそれだけで楽しいの?」
“But is it really that fun just like that?”

167
00:27:44,304 --> 00:27:47,604
もうなんだって蒟蒻問答
It's just konjac dialogue no matter what!

168
00:27:48,104 --> 00:27:48,904
いよーっ ぽん!
Yo, pon!

169
00:27:48,904 --> 00:27:53,104
どこからともなく現れて すぐどこか行っちゃって神出鬼没 チャンスを待ったら一日千秋 追いかければ東奔西走
Appearing out of nowhere and vanishing somewhere instantly, omnipresent! Waiting for a chance feels like a thousand autumns, chasing it brings us running in all directions!

170
00:27:54,104 --> 00:27:57,104
時代は常に千変万化 人の心は複雑怪奇
The times are always changing infinitely, the human heart is complex and bizarre!

171
00:27:57,104 --> 00:28:00,104
「でも本気でそんなこと言ってんの?」
“But are you seriously saying things like that?”

172
00:28:00,104 --> 00:28:07,604
もうどうにも満身創痍 嗚呼 巡り巡って夜の街
We're already battered and bruised all over, ah, wandering around the town at night!

173
00:28:08,104 --> 00:28:12,604
キミは合図出し踊りだす
You give the signal and start to dance!

174
00:28:13,604 --> 00:28:19,104
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ 回レ回レ回レ回レ! 華麗に花弁 散らすように
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, like scattering gorgeous petals!

175
00:28:19,104 --> 00:28:24,604
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ 回レ回レ回レ回レ! 髪も振り乱して
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, tossing your hair in disorder!

176
00:28:25,104 --> 00:28:30,604
一昨日 昨日 今日と 明日と 明後日と この宴は続く
The day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, and the day after tomorrow, this banquet continues!

177
00:28:31,104 --> 00:28:37,604
踊レ 歌エ 一心不乱に回レ! 今宵は雪月花
Dance, sing, spin around single-mindedly! Tonight is Setsugetsuka!

178
00:28:42,604 --> 00:28:43,604
いよーっ ぽん!
Yo, pon!

179
00:28:49,904 --> 00:28:55,604
ねぇねぇねぇ この世に平安訪れるの? のべつ幕無し丁丁発止 兵ども千客万来 ひしめき合う群雄割拠
Hey, hey, hey, will peace ever visit this world? Non-stop fierce debate, soldiers and guests alike flocking in, rival warlords crowding together!

180
00:28:56,104 --> 00:28:59,104
伸るか反るか一攫千金 気が付いたら絶体絶命
Sink or swim, making a fortune, before you know it, you're in a desperate situation!

181
00:28:59,104 --> 00:29:02,104
「でも本音のとこ どうなってんの?」
“But how is it really deep down inside?”

182
00:29:02,104 --> 00:29:09,104
もうまったく奇想天外 嗚呼 辿り辿って夜の街
It's completely bizarre and imaginative, ah, wandering and tracing our way through the night town!

183
00:29:09,604 --> 00:29:14,104
迷い一つなく踊りだす
Starting to dance without a single hesitation!

184
00:29:15,104 --> 00:29:18,104
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ 回レ回レ回レ回レ! 華麗に花弁 散らすように
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, like scattering gorgeous petals!

185
00:29:21,104 --> 00:29:25,604
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ 回レ回レ回レ回レ! 髪も振り乱して
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, tossing your hair in disorder!

186
00:29:26,104 --> 00:29:31,104
一昨日 昨日 今日と 明日と 明後日と この宴は続く
The day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, and the day after tomorrow, this banquet continues!

187
00:29:31,604 --> 00:29:38,604
踊レ 歌エ 一心不乱に回レ! 今宵は雪月花
Dance, sing, spin around single-mindedly! Tonight is Setsugetsuka!

188
00:30:00,158 --> 00:30:02,238
ハッハッハッハッハッハッハイヤ
Ha ha ha ha ha ha hayai!

189
00:30:02,936 --> 00:30:08,036
花で一つ 鳥で二つ 手打ち鳴らす
One for flowers, two for birds, clapping our hands...

190
00:30:08,936 --> 00:31:05,236
風で三つ 嗚呼 月出て四つ 鳴らす鳴らす
Three for the wind, ah, four when the moon comes out, keeping the rhythm going...

191
00:31:20,079 --> 00:31:25,679
[Title: 宵々古今]
[Title: Yoi Yoi Kokon]

192
00:31:32,379 --> 00:31:34,579
らっしゃいな 平は成り
Welcome, peace is established

193
00:31:34,879 --> 00:31:37,279
時が来た 正しい夢現 夜もすがら
The time has come, a true dream and reality all night long

194
00:31:38,879 --> 00:31:42,379
変わりゆくことに恐れなし のっぴきならないのは御免
With no fear of change, unavoidable matters are out of the question

195
00:31:42,679 --> 00:31:44,879
手毬唄歌い
Singing a temari song

196
00:31:45,079 --> 00:31:47,379
君達が誘う
You all invite me

197
00:31:47,679 --> 00:31:51,279
悪人に後ろ髪を惹かれても 進むべきなり
Even if dragged back by evildoers, we must push forward

198
00:31:58,379 --> 00:32:03,379
流行り廃りの憂き世なら
In this fickle, fleeting world of trends

199
00:32:03,679 --> 00:32:07,479
信ずる者はただ、君だけと
The only one I believe in is you

200
00:32:07,879 --> 00:32:11,179
踊れ騒げや 呑めや歌えや 案ずることなどないな
Dance and make noise, drink and sing, there's nothing to worry about

201
00:32:11,479 --> 00:32:15,579
此の世人の世は恨めしい 雪駄はちゃらちゃら 愛し
This world of humans is resentful, clinking straw sandals affectionately

202
00:32:15,879 --> 00:32:19,879
縋って眩んで満身創痍で (それそれそれそれ)
Clinging, dazzling, covered in battle scars (Sore, sore, sore, sore!)

203
00:32:23,979 --> 00:32:26,579
今を嘆いて昔を粧しても
Even if we lament the present and dress up the past

204
00:32:26,879 --> 00:32:30,279
君の心の内 流る涙川
A river of tears flowing inside your heart

205
00:32:30,579 --> 00:32:33,379
それじゃ敵わん 何処にいても めくるめく舞台に君を連れて
There's no rivaling that, wherever you are, taking you to the dazzling stage

206
00:32:33,679 --> 00:32:37,479
めくるめく舞台に君を連れて
Taking you to the dazzling stage

207
00:32:51,179 --> 00:32:56,579
あまりてなどか人ぞ悲しき 身勝手なのが世の理か
Why are people so sorrowful? Is selfishness the principle of the world?

208
00:32:56,879 --> 00:33:00,279
万人持つ理想 虚像の偶像
Everyone holds ideals, illusions of idols

209
00:33:00,579 --> 00:33:03,379
俗な答えなどはあらざらむ
There can be no vulgar answers

210
00:33:03,679 --> 00:33:09,179
僕ら巡りあうこと まさに一期一会
Meeting one another—truly a once-in-a-lifetime encounter

211
00:33:10,579 --> 00:33:15,579
酸いも甘いも試練 連れ添ってこの手握って
Both the bitter and the sweet are trials, accompanying each other, clasping this hand

212
00:33:16,879 --> 00:33:22,279
生きづらい此処、浮き世から 旗を掲げよ
Raise the banner from this hard-to-live floating world!

213
00:33:22,579 --> 00:33:25,379
宵闇が明く
The twilight breaks

214
00:33:25,679 --> 00:33:29,179
酔いどれアガれや 寝れば忘るる 昔も今も変わらず
Drunkards, rise up! Sleep and forget, past and present unchanged

215
00:33:29,479 --> 00:33:33,379
浮き世人の世嘆かわしい いつだってちゃんちゃら をかし
The floating world of humans is lamentable, always hilariously absurd and delightful

216
00:33:33,679 --> 00:33:37,379
荒んで笑って合縁奇縁で (それそれそれそれ)
Roughly laughing through strange ties of fate (Sore, sore, sore, sore!)

217
00:33:37,679 --> 00:33:41,379
深まる春も凍てつく雪の日も
Even in deepening spring or freezing snowy days

218
00:33:41,679 --> 00:33:45,379
日出ずるすべての瞬きを君と見よう
Let's witness every twinkle of the rising sun with you

219
00:33:48,879 --> 00:33:54,879
彩る色 何処までも 空前なる見晴らしを眺めて
Coloring everywhere, gazing out at an unprecedented view

220
00:33:58,279 --> 00:34:00,379
負けて花一匁
Losing at hana-ichimonme

221
00:34:00,679 --> 00:34:04,279
欲しがる欲しがる欲しがる声 勝て恨んで買って選んで 呆気ないって泣いて
Voices crying out for more, winning and resenting, buying and choosing, crying that it's anticlimactic

222
00:34:04,579 --> 00:34:07,379
猿真似の何番煎じじゃ満ち足りないない
Repeated stale ape-imitations are never enough

223
00:34:07,679 --> 00:34:11,379
未だ進む道半ば哉 如何なる時も歩を前へ出せ
We are still halfway on our path; at any time, put your steps forward

224
00:34:15,179 --> 00:34:19,379
未だ進む道半ば哉 如何なる時も歩を前へ出せ
We are still halfway on our path; at any time, put your steps forward

225
00:34:23,679 --> 00:34:29,179
流行り廃りの憂き世なら 信ずる者はただ、君だけと
In this fickle, fleeting world of trends, the only one I believe in is you

226
00:34:36,679 --> 00:34:40,279
踊れ騒げや 呑めや歌えや 案ずることなどないな
Dance and make noise, drink and sing, there's nothing to worry about

227
00:34:40,579 --> 00:34:44,379
此の世人の世は恨めしい 雪駄はちゃらちゃら 愛し
This world of humans is resentful, clinking straw sandals affectionately

228
