Let's smile, crying is losing, let's laugh recklessly!

243
00:37:16,227 --> 00:37:21,927
波乱万丈 酸いも甘いも乗り越えたあっぱれ日本人
Through all ups and downs, bitter and sweet, overcoming it all, what fine Japanese people!

244
00:37:22,127 --> 00:37:27,627
笑おう どんな時でもなにくそ笑いましょう
Let's smile, no matter what time it is, let's laugh in defiance!

245
