ぐわっはっは にょっほっほ
Guhhahha, nyohhohho!

246
00:37:31,127 --> 00:37:33,927
空気なんて読まずに笑っとけ
Laugh without worrying about reading the room!

247
00:37:34,127 --> 00:37:40,027
笑顔！ 笑顔！ 笑顔！ 笑う門には福来る！
Smiles! Smiles! Smiles! Fortune comes to those who smile!

248
