258
00:38:28,227 --> 00:38:33,927
笑おう 口角上げて ひたすら笑いましょう
Let's smile, raise the corners of our mouths and just keep laughing!

259
00:38:34,127 --> 00:38:39,927
応仁の乱 大ききんさえクリアして現代日本人
Clearing even the Ōnin War and great famines, modern Japanese people!

260
00:38:40,127 --> 00:38:45,127
笑おう 未来永劫 グハハと笑いましょう
Let's smile for eternity, let's laugh with a guhaha!

261
00:39:10,127 --> 00:39:15,627
小娘のたわごと、と切り捨てないで
Don't just dismiss a young girl's idle talk,

262
00:39:15,927 --> 00:39:22,127
しかめつらなんか変な顔 笑顔を見たいから
Frowning makes a weird face, because we want to see your smile!

263
00:39:23,927 --> 00:39:29,627
笑おう 笑おう さあ笑いましょう こんな時代こそ笑いましょう
Let's smile, let's smile, come on let's smile, let's smile especially in times like these!

264
00:39:30,127 --> 00:39:35,627
笑おう 泣いたら負けだ やけくそ笑いましょう
Let's smile, crying is losing, let's laugh recklessly!

265
00:39:35,927 --> 00:39:41,327
波乱万丈 酸いも甘いも乗り越えたあっぱれ日本人
Through all ups and downs, bitter and sweet, overcoming it all, what fine Japanese people!

266
00:39:41,627 --> 00:39:46,927
笑おう どんな時でもなにくそ笑いましょう
Let's smile, no matter what time it is, let's laugh in defiance!

267
00:39:47,127 --> 00:39:50,127
ひたすら笑いましょう
Let's just keep laughing!

268
00:39:50,627 --> 00:39:53,127
ぐわっはっは にょっほっほ
Guhhahha, nyohhohho!

269
00:39:53,627 --> 00:39:56,127
空気なんて読まずに笑っとけ
Laugh without worrying about reading the room!

270
00:39:56,327 --> 00:40:00,229
笑顔！ 笑顔！ 笑顔！ 笑顔！
Smiles! Smiles! Smiles! Smiles!

271
00:40:52,450 --> 00:40:56,430
死んでも夢を叶えたい　いや、死んでも夢は叶えられない
Even in death I want to fulfill my dreams... No, even in death dreams cannot be fulfilled!

272
00:40:56,700 --> 00:40:59,400
それは絶望？それとも希望？
Is that despair? Or is it hope?

273
00:40:59,730 --> 00:41:05,520
過酷な運命乗り越えて脈がなくても突き進む　それが私たちのサガだから
Overcoming a harsh fate, pressing forward even without a pulse—because that is our saga!

274
00:41:06,120 --> 00:41:10,620
誰が弔う　死地は彼方
Who will mourn us? The fatal land is far away.

275
00:41:11,250 --> 00:41:16,140
静寂を破り　芽吹いた夢を
Breaking the silence, a budding dream...

276
00:41:16,140 --> 00:41:19,120
誓え 穿て
Vow, pierce through!

277
00:41:19,570 --> 00:41:21,950
重なる屍
Stacked corpses,

278
00:41:22,120 --> 00:41:26,650
高みへ
to the heights.

279
00:41:26,960 --> 00:41:31,890
届くまで
Until we reach it!

280
00:41:32,090 --> 00:41:35,010
唸れ 徒花
Roar, adabana!

281
00:41:35,110 --> 00:41:39,100
朽ち果てても進め
Even if we rot to ruin, press forward!

282
00:41:39,250 --> 00:41:42,240
奪わせはしない 尊厳の愚弄に
We will not let them mock our dignity!

283
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:45,420
飢餓を解き放て
Unleash the hunger!

284
00:41:45,610 --> 00:41:50,250
枯れても走る ことを命と呼べ
Call running even when withered your very life!

285
00:41:50,420 --> 00:41:53,410
空に叫ぶ 脱・生存の定義
Shout into the sky: the anti-definition of survival!

286
00:41:53,410 --> 00:41:54,710
骨を斬らせて 闇を断て
Risk skin and bone to cut the darkness!

287
00:42:15,030 --> 00:42:19,490
傷ひとつ無い 手など愚か
A hand without a single scratch is foolish.

288
00:42:19,890 --> 00:42:24,580
意思も自由も その身を投げて
Throw willpower, freedom, and your very body into it!

289
00:42:24,920 --> 00:42:27,900
守れ
Protect them!

290
00:42:28,130 --> 00:42:31,090
退くな
Do not retreat!

291
00:42:31,220 --> 00:42:35,900
涙も 血も無い 神話を
A myth without tears or blood...

292
00:42:36,020 --> 00:42:40,960
築くまで
Until we build it!

293
00:42:41,980 --> 00:42:47,490
燃えろ 修羅花 鼓動亡き世界で
Burn, Shura flower! In a world devoid of heartbeats,

294
00:42:47,770 --> 00:42:51,790
摂理に抗い 天命も無礼に
Defying providence, treating fate with disrespect,

295
00:42:52,090 --> 00:42:54,780
腐鎖切り抜けて
Slash your way through the corrupt chains!

296
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:58,850
心を無くすことが死と知れ
Know that losing your heart is true death!

297
00:42:59,500 --> 00:43:03,040
極めど儚い偶像の寵児
To the ephemeral darling of idols at their peak,

298
00:43:03,330 --> 00:43:06,880
目には目を剥き 牙を剥け
An eye for an eye, bare your fangs!

299
00:43:07,230 --> 00:43:11,090
いつか誰もが散華する捨て石
Someday everyone is a stepping stone scattered in sacrifice.

300
00:43:11,420 --> 00:43:15,010
輝け 刹那無限の火花
Shine! Sparks of infinite transience.

301
00:43:15,220 --> 00:43:17,410
乱世に迸る サガ
Gushing forth in a turbulent era, the Saga!

302
00:43:17,410 --> 00:43:21,160
S A G A

303
00:43:41,220 --> 00:43:46,510
何が神の冒涜か 裁きなどさせない
What is divine desecration? We will not allow judgment!

304
00:43:46,790 --> 00:43:50,300
希望 高らかに打ち鳴らせ
Ring out hope high and clear!

305
00:43:50,420 --> 00:43:54,450
呼吸よりも生きた証
Proof of life, more than mere breathing.

306
00:43:54,730 --> 00:43:57,350
唸れ
Roar!

307
00:43:57,450 --> 00:44:00,010
徒花 朽ち果てても進め
Adabana, even if we rot to ruin, press forward!

308
00:44:00,210 --> 00:44:04,400
奪わせはしない 尊厳の愚弄に
We will not let them desecrate our dignity!

309
00:44:04,700 --> 00:44:09,410
飢餓を解き放て 枯れても走る
Unleash the hunger! Run even if you wither away!

310
00:44:09,640 --> 00:44:12,290
命と呼べ
Call it life!

311
00:44:12,440 --> 00:44:16,430
空に叫ぶ 脱・生存の定義
Shout into the sky: the anti-definition of survival!

312
00:44:16,620 --> 00:44:19,570
骨を斬らせて 闇を断て
Risk skin and bone to cut the darkness!

313
00:44:19,830 --> 00:44:22,610
雲間に光る 簒奪の勝機
A usurping chance for victory shining through the clouds!

314
00:44:22,860 --> 00:44:27,110
覚悟を 宿命に突きつけて
Thrust your resolve into fate,

315
00:44:27,350 --> 00:44:29,950
荒野を駆ける 乱世に挑む
Galloping across the wasteland, challenging a turbulent era!

316
00:44:30,190 --> 00:44:32,720
天下に狂い咲く サガ
Blooming madly across the world, the Saga!

317
00:44:32,720 --> 00:44:37,900
S A G A

318
00:45:19,550 --> 00:45:23,650
寄り添う二人に君がオーバーラップ
You overlap with the two of us standing close...

319
00:45:24,250 --> 00:45:29,350
色なき風に思い馳せて
Letting my thoughts drift on the colorless wind...

320
00:45:29,950 --> 00:45:33,950
触れた手の温もり 今も...
The warmth of the hands we touched, even now...

321
00:45:34,250 --> 00:45:40,050
Stop 時間を止めて
Stop, time...

322
00:45:40,150 --> 00:45:43,850
そう いつの日だって
Yes, no matter what day it is...

323
00:45:44,350 --> 00:45:48,950
君の言葉 忘れないの
I will never forget your words.

324
00:45:49,350 --> 00:45:54,750
会いたい時に 会えない
When I want to see you, I can't meet you...

325
00:45:55,250 --> 00:46:00,650
切なくて もどかしい
It's so painful, so frustrating...

326
00:46:01,450 --> 00:46:06,850
から紅に染まる渡月橋
Togetsukyo Bridge dyed in deep crimson...

327
00:46:07,550 --> 00:46:11,650
導かれる日 願って
Praying for the day we are guided together...

328
00:46:11,850 --> 00:46:17,850
川の流れに祈りを込めて
Putting my prayer into the flow of the river...

329
00:46:18,250 --> 00:46:22,650
I've been thinking about you

330
00:46:23,150 --> 00:46:27,850
いつも こころ 君のそば
Always in my heart, by your side...

331
00:46:38,350 --> 00:46:42,650
いにしえの景色 変わりなく
The scenery of antiquity remains unchanged...

332
00:46:43,550 --> 00:46:48,450
今 この瞳に映し出す
Projecting it into these eyes right now...

333
00:46:49,150 --> 00:46:52,950
彩りゆく 季節越えて
Crossing over the changing seasons...

334
00:46:53,450 --> 00:46:58,850
Stock 覚えていますか？
Stock... Do you remember?

335
00:46:59,450 --> 00:47:07,550
ねぇ いつになったら また 巡り会えるのかな
Hey, when will we be able to meet again?

336
00:47:08,650 --> 00:47:13,950
会いたい時に 会えない
When I want to see you, I can't meet you...

337
00:47:14,450 --> 00:47:19,650
この胸を 焦がすの
It scorches this heart of mine...

338
00:47:21,050 --> 00:47:26,650
から紅に水くくるとき
When the water is dyed in deep crimson...

339
00:47:26,950 --> 00:47:29,950
君との想い つなげて
Connecting my thoughts with yours...

340
00:47:30,550 --> 00:47:36,650
川の流れに祈りを込めて
Putting my prayer into the flow of the river...

341
00:47:37,150 --> 00:47:41,950
I've been thinking about you

342
00:47:42,250 --> 00:47:46,950
いつも 君を 探してる
Always searching for you...

343
00:47:47,650 --> 00:47:51,650
君となら 不安さえ
With you, even anxiety...

344
00:47:52,050 --> 00:47:57,250
どんな時も消えていくよ
Will fade away no matter what time it is...

345
00:47:57,550 --> 00:48:07,350
いつになったら 優しく抱きしめられるのかな
When will I be gently held in your arms?

346
00:48:08,550 --> 00:48:17,950
から紅の紅葉達さえ 熱い思いを告げては
Even the crimson maple leaves tell of passionate feelings...

347
00:48:19,250 --> 00:48:24,650
ゆらり揺れて歌っています
Swaying gently, I am singing...

348
00:48:25,050 --> 00:48:29,650
I've been thinking about you

349
00:48:30,550 --> 00:48:39,950
いつも いつも 君 想ふ
Always, always thinking of you...

350
00:49:16,950 --> 00:49:22,350
はーいというわけでここまでどうでしたでしょうか！
Ha~i, so how was it up to this point?!

351
00:49:22,450 --> 00:49:29,250
いや、もう数多くのゲストに出ていただいて、
Man, we had so many guests come on,

352
00:49:29,250 --> 00:49:35,050
