and I'm really so happy today.

353
00:49:35,050 --> 00:49:44,350
本当に今回はね、だいぶ最初にも言ったんですけど、ちょっと和風な感じでまとめさせていただいたので、
As I said quite a bit at the very beginning, this time we put everything together in a Japanese traditional style,

354
00:49:44,450 --> 00:49:50,250
曲も、もうほぼほぼ全部和風っぽい感じで、ちょっと雰囲気をね、一つに統一して
and the songs are also almost entirely in that Japanese style, uniting the atmosphere into one,

